## FP-003 — ordinary claim under the Order Form (§ 5.1, 300% of annual fees)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp003:
  output computation content L.LiabilityCap

scope TestFp003:
  definition computation equals
    output of L.LiabilityCap with {
      -- fees_paid_last_12mo: $240,000
      -- annual_fees: $240,000
      -- claim_type: T.ClaimType.Ordinary
      -- claim_date: |2026-09-15|
    }
  assertion computation.cap = $720,000
  assertion computation.uncapped = false
```

```catala-test-cli
