│ computation = LiabilityCap {
│                 -- cap: $720,000.00
│                 -- uncapped: false
│               }
└─
```

## FP-004 — IP indemnity claim under the Order Form (§ 5.2, 500% supercap)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp004:
  output computation content L.LiabilityCap

scope TestFp004:
  definition computation equals
    output of L.LiabilityCap with {
      -- fees_paid_last_12mo: $240,000
      -- annual_fees: $240,000
      -- claim_type: T.ClaimType.IpIndemnity
      -- claim_date: |2026-09-15|
    }
  assertion computation.cap = $1,200,000
  assertion computation.uncapped = false
```

```catala-test-cli
