## FP-005 — gross negligence: no cap at all (MSA § 9.4, preserved by Order Form § 5.3)

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFp005:
  output computation content L.LiabilityCap

scope TestFp005:
  definition computation equals
    output of L.LiabilityCap with {
      -- fees_paid_last_12mo: $240,000
      -- annual_fees: $240,000
      -- claim_type: T.ClaimType.GrossNegligence
      -- claim_date: |2026-09-15|
    }
  assertion computation.uncapped = true
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope TestFp005
┌─[RESULT]─ TestFp005 ─
│ computation = LiabilityCap {
│                 -- cap: $240,000.00
│                 -- uncapped: true
│               }
└─
```
